-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 28, 2021</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\">Something Is Killing the Children #17</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19\">Something Is Killing the Children #19</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #18</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on July 28, 2021 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the eighteenth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>What secrets lie at the heart of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>, and her rival <span class=\"new\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter (comics) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWFyb25fU2xhdWdodGVyXyhjb21pY3MpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Aaron</span>, will soon learn as they are pulled deeper and deeper into the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a>... but the truth may destroy them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a> awakens on the farm and immediately lights a cigarette. Pocketing his <a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Azure Masks\">azure mask</a>, he makes coffee, goes to the porch, and asks a waiting <a href=\"/wiki/Buck_Slaughter\" title=\"Buck Slaughter\">Buck Slaughter</a> how many monkeys they'd need to release into the wild for a decent breeding population to get into the upper midwest of the United States. Buck doesn't respond until Gary asks if the Slaughterhouse is ready, to which he simply hums an affirmative. \n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica</a> arrives at the farm, and is happily greeted by Gary and his dogs. He takes <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> inside for breakfast, where she plays with the dogs. They discuss the farm for a moment, with Gary explaining that it's not much of a farm, but more of a training spot where they can't be seen in the public. Erica asks if that means they keep monsters there; while Jessica reprimands her, Gary simply responds that they do. He tells her to say goodbye to the dogs, and to use the bathroom. \n</p><p>Outside the Slaughterhouse, a large barn with the insignia of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a> over the door, Erica notices the dogs whining. Jessica affirms that she's going to do great, puts on her mask, and tells her how to begin the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Sacrament of Initiation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2FjcmFtZW50X29mX0luaXRpYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Sacrament of Initiation</span>. Erica goes inside alone, telling an angry <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a> to shush, where she sees Gary behind an altar in the darkness, with only two candles lighting the area. She steps into a marked circle in the room's center, says she has no name, and places Octo on the altar. Gary asks her if she remembers its eyes, and Erica flashes back to when she saw it kill her parents, dropped her octopus, and rushed out to fight it. Gary releases the monster inside of Octo, swearing as it enters Erica's mind and puts her in an unconscious trance. He places the plush on her stomach then leaves, and tells Jessica that she should have warned him how dangerous that monster was, as he's now convinced it's going to kill Erica. The adults then leave to drink.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Gary's dogs\n<ul><li>Sparta</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Buck_Slaughter\" title=\"Buck Slaughter\">Buck Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Civilians\">Civilians</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Mark †</li>\n<li>Erica's mother †</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratypes</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"38457bc6693d749735ed860214368c52\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 18 Cover.jpg (990 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/a/a3/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18_Cov